    "notes": "APG has no stepper page; the contract is an ordered list with aria-current=\"step\". No arrow keys, so no direction-sensitive binding. RTL: step 1 is on the right, connectors and the progress fill run right-to-left, and the Next button sits at inline-end (left) with a mirrored chevron. Step numbers use the locale's digits."
